，拟开展</span><strong><span>线上学术交流活动</span></strong><span>，开营时间拟定于</span><strong><span>7月31日</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/JiaKpsAepicIl7PdAljv8icWuABda3rS6iceXHy2Z4PS019qPMMphiaKe0BSiaynBBxGiaWNjOnb4SsKygCs94AcXJ9mjNibZseIoO8zvLibJFsTqTuI/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/VKm1v8ZiaAfPOJj9CdCiacmEfnMicDIjNTTc5yic2CgXajFkjYhsrd3HbHzU0ODo2ojeHS6xVIPtrPt3RUxMwsnke5mt5AvicZ93p1hD6QloaDGY/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/VKm1v8ZiaAfPVMrQV0j03NNRDqLnRc8oQGPD877cIyMCibNHrRXX9c4XPJ4oe4W6s1ibMDG6XzxWt2MhEC1UbZTMLyAPe1pibaoPsVRVJ6fFuFQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/CCDdjQUaibl1KCgsBg2Yj9dnbbwFYaTymr7wtTsfC7BF1wofv79oDicicPcHFhUDeIRXeZicEVjVIicSvNc6EVTJMj7E7poTvud8TlzH7LmaWa3k/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/CCDdjQUaibl0sCicemFHcNaRjy8ENBdfibRkYABxwepuQvW4L0ics9Usyb4GLFtJ764mRqO5ibBlAx9lpotNib6WgdJ3s8NAA9oLuD6J0KNsKy9icE/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/CCDdjQUaibl2FDFywVdlg3LOoqHyrjI7b4HG6DQhqVibg4TdyQmNeHpvpz6CKAZPUtey